in co-op, or race to win in versus mode. (Controller/Gamepad required for local multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shopper Class Progression</strong> \u2013 Level up through 5 shopper ranks with permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn. Upgrade. Repeat.</strong> \u2013 Your shopper rank persists across runs, unlocking higher stats and bigger payouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Pickups</strong> \u2013 Unlock boosts like speed carts, cash multipliers, and weird gimmicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Gamepad Support</strong> \u2013 Optimized for couch play with local co-op and versus modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Replay Value</strong> \u2013 Unlock ridiculous milestones and chase high scores with randomized runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Flair</strong> \u2013 Vibrant vector-pixel visuals, snappy soundtrack, and arcade-style presentation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
